Subject: module.prop: drop updateJson
Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [a local package must not be replaced by upstream releases]
Drop-when: this package is replaced by an unmodified upstream release

With updateJson the Manager offers upstream's latest release as an
update, which would silently replace this reviewed local package.
---
diff --git a/module.prop b/module.prop
index 38966328c155ea2759b8c458759a185c4ba0ec3e..59e1ca1ed3d9b1037d3a627ccbd60e72b621deee 100644
--- a/module.prop
+++ b/module.prop
@@ -4,7 +4,6 @@ version=v1.5.2-R28
 versionCode=105002028
 author=sidex15 & simonpunk
 description=An addon root hiding service for KernelSU compiled with patched kernel source.
-updateJson=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/sidex15/ksu_module_susfs/v1.5.2+/update.json
 banner=banner.png
 webuiIcon=susfsicon.png
 actionIcon=susfsicon.png
